{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-65",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Read a car's speed-versus-time graph in one shared original lattice. Preserve every source polyline vertex and stop at the source endpoints; do not label or classify the requested time intervals.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/figures/fig-65.png",
      "sha256": "857a3f7c726386602e1aa2a187eead92e4126f8a4e9c3a3705e3f2f6996fa054"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-ex",
        "exercise": "942",
        "text": "942. 在图65里，画出了在路上行驶的小汽车的速度的图象。指出小汽车速度增大、减小和保持不变的时间间隔。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-lattice",
        "description": "One continuous 37-column, 18-row lattice, 38 vertical and 19 horizontal lines. Bounds t=-15..170 and v=-8..28; minor steps 5 seconds and 2 meters per second. No source-filled region. Modern deskewing retains the exact counts and phase.",
        "objects": [
          "source-grid"
        ],
        "assertions": [
          "source-grid-size"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "gridDimensions"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "source-polyline",
        "description": "Solid unmarked source vertices read from the grid: (0,0),(15,16),(30,16),(35,8),(45,8),(50,0),(60,0),(70,16),(90,16),(100,0),(115,0),(120,8),(140,8),(150,0). All 13 segments remain in the same frame. Tiny computational points are subsumed inside the line, not new visible point markers or labels.",
        "objects": [
          "curve-p00",
          "curve-p01",
          "curve-p02",
          "curve-p03",
          "curve-p04",
          "curve-p05",
